-- MediaPipe hand landmark model ---------------------------------------

  Copyright 2021 The MediaPipe Authors / Google LLC.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Model: "Hand Tracking (Lite/Full) with Fairness", October 2021.
  Obtained through the STMicroelectronics model zoo, itself a conversion
  of the PINTO model zoo entry 033_Hand_Detection_and_Tracking.

  THIS MODEL WAS NOT TRAINED BY THIS PROJECT. MedSight selected it,
  quantised it, compiled it to Neural-ART and integrated it. This notice
  is required by Apache-2.0 section 4 and is the single most important
  attribution in this file.

  Note on use: in MediaPipe this model never sees a whole scene - a palm
  detector runs first and hands it a tight crop. MedSight does not ship
  that palm detector, so the model is used outside its intended pipeline.
  It reports hand presence reliably when the hand is centred and large in
  its input, which is the case this device needs, and does not localise a
  hand elsewhere in the frame.


